### 1. COLOR CONSTANTS (`/src/shared/styles/colors.styles.ts`)

```typescript
const text = {
  white: "#EEEEEE",
  white5: "#EEEEEE0D",
  white10: "#EEEEEE1A",
  white20: "#EEEEEE33",
  white30: "#EEEEEE4D",
  white50: "#EEEEEE80",
